{"declarations":[{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Data/Markdown/Unicode/CaseFolding.html#Lean.Markdown.caseFold\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Markdown</span>.<span class=\"name\">caseFold</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">c</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Char\">Char</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#String\">String</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"The Unicode full case folding of `c` for the following characters:\n* ASCII\n* The Latin-1 Supplement block\n* The Greek and Coptic block\n* All other characters whose foldings are drawn from the above blocks:\n  - `Ÿ`, `ẞ`, `ſ`\n  - The Ohm, Kelvin, and Angstrom signs\n  - The Latin ligatures `ﬀ` to `ﬆ`\n  - The polytonic Greek letters with iota subscript.\n\nFor characters not in the above set, `caseFold` is equivalent to `String.singleton`. In particular,\nletters with case in Cyrillic, the Latin Extended blocks (Turkish, Vietnamese, Polish, Czech, and\nothers), Armenian, Georgian, Cherokee, Greek Extended (polytonic Greek), and the fullwidth and\nenclosed forms are not folded. This limitation may be lifted in the future.","docLink":"./Lean/Data/Markdown/Unicode/CaseFolding.html#Lean.Markdown.caseFold","kind":"def","line":177,"name":"Lean.Markdown.caseFold","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Data/Markdown/Unicode/CaseFolding.lean#L177-L193"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Data/Markdown/Unicode/CaseFolding.html#Lean.Markdown.pushCaseFolded\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Markdown</span>.<span class=\"name\">pushCaseFolded</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">out</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#String\">String</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">c</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Char\">Char</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#String\">String</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Appends the Unicode full case folding of `c` to `out`, for ASCII, the Latin-1 Supplement block, the\nGreek and Coptic block, and the other characters whose foldings are drawn from those blocks. Any\nother character is appended unchanged.","docLink":"./Lean/Data/Markdown/Unicode/CaseFolding.html#Lean.Markdown.pushCaseFolded","kind":"def","line":163,"name":"Lean.Markdown.pushCaseFolded","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Data/Markdown/Unicode/CaseFolding.lean#L163-L175"}}],"imports":["Init.Data.Char.Basic","Init.Data.String.Basic"],"instances":[],"name":"Lean.Data.Markdown.Unicode.CaseFolding"}